+name=ops/docs/LEVEL4_FINAL_RUN_INSTRUCTIONS.md
+contents:
+This document explains the exact sequence to execute the Level‑4 production proofs and finalize evidence for Legal/Compliance.
+
+Prereqs:
+- Tekton installed and level4/master pipelines present.
+- Ray cluster available for HPO trials.
+- Prometheus & Jaeger available for OTEL verification.
+- S3 evidence bucket accessible by Tekton service account (IRSA or AWS creds).
+- cosign key/public key available to signer/verifier (/secrets/cosign.key, /secrets/cosign.pub).
+
+1) Configure evidence bucket in env:
+   export EVIDENCE_BUCKET=s3://aegis-evidence-prod
+
+2) Apply the filled PipelineRun (in-cluster):
+   sed 's|s3://REPLACE_WITH_YOUR_EVIDENCE_BUCKET|'"${EVIDENCE_BUCKET}"'|g' ops/tekton/pipelineruns/production_proofs_pipelinerun_filled.yaml > /tmp/pr.yaml
+   kubectl apply -f /tmp/pr.yaml
+
+3) Or run the orchestrator locally (requires network/credentials):
+   python3 ops/production/level4_proofs_orchestrator.py
+
+4) Monitor progress (Tekton & Ray). When pipeline finishes:
+   aws s3 ls ${EVIDENCE_BUCKET}/production_proofs/
+   aws s3 cp ${EVIDENCE_BUCKET}/production_proofs/summary-<ts>.json /tmp/summary.json
+
+5) Run final acceptance checks locally if needed:
+   python3 ops/validation/acceptance_checker.py --evidence ${EVIDENCE_BUCKET} --out /tmp/acceptance.json
+   python3 ops/validation/postmortem_generator.py --acceptance /tmp/acceptance.json
+
+6) If acceptance passes and Security signs off:
+   - Promote Gatekeeper constraints:
+       ./ops/gatekeeper/promote_and_verify.sh
+   - Prepare compliance package:
+       EVIDENCE_BUCKET=${EVIDENCE_BUCKET} ./ops/ops/prepare_compliance_package.sh
+
+7) Keep long_term_monitor running for weeks and provide audit reports to Legal.
+
+End of file.
+
